# Every text file is LF in every checkout, whatever the local git says.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, and the first Windows run
# checked out 343 of 354 text files with CRLF (docs/windows_findings.md,
# item 7). The goldens are compared byte for byte, and a sample or a lesson
# with CRLF made every driver edit that searches for "\n" match nothing.
# Studio itself copes with a CRLF file a PERSON saved (studio_docs keeps the
# ending); this is about the repository's own files.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ttf binary
